OL,3,GNEWSARubbish dump alley now hosts bingo
OL,4,Anights
OL,5,
OL,6,FBingo nights are being held in an
OL,7,Falleyway after residents removed tonnes
OL,8,Fof rubbish.
OL,10,FThe alley off Wellington Street,
OL,11,FGrimsby, was so full of fly-tipped
OL,12,Fwaste, residents could not go near it.
OL,14,FNow, they have turned it into an urban
OL,15,Foasis with a library, a wildlife pond,
OL,16,Fplants, bird and bat boxes.
OL,18,FResident Jilleen Bee said: "You
OL,19,Fcouldn't move for the rubbish, it was
OL,20,Fhorrendous. There were beds, sofas,
OL,21,Fbikes, mattresses, white goods, you
OL,22,Fname it, it was down here."
